{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feng Shui Meowjong is a unique light roguelike card game that fuses traditional mahjong mechanics with roguelike progression and mystical Feng Shui-inspired tactics.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this strategic turn-based system, you reinterpret classic mahjong gameplay using a fixed set of 14 tiles to form combinations such as Chi (Chow), Pong (Pung), and Pair. At the same time, you activate powerful Feng Shui treasure effects, manage skill cards, and take on increasingly challenging enemies. Every run tests your planning, adaptability, and strategic thinking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/b103b124c7c10997f45f9a2300595d13.avif?t=1773742740\" width=928 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Deep to Master</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mahjong experience required. Simple to pick up yet deeply strategic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless blend of Eastern tradition and modern roguelike design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty and complexity scale as you progress, constantly evolving your strategy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/8ded10cad9f4bb0c1b01b9c61dddbfe1.avif?t=1773742740\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/fa764e68683c4a54ccc77446ae3a67ae.avif?t=1773742740\" width=928 height=108 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new treasures, cards, and effects by defeating enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost score times fan through treasure synergies to unleash massive score explosions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/0d5df7e811fd6dcc6f425e6852622330.poster.avif?t=1773742740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/0d5df7e811fd6dcc6f425e6852622330.webm?t=1773742740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/0d5df7e811fd6dcc6f425e6852622330.mp4?t=1773742740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/1c253b3045212c8e628c7056693f3568.avif?t=1773742740\" width=928 height=108 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use skill cards to manipulate tiles, increase scores, or modify treasure effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasures interact to create powerful synergies, enabling varied deck-building paths and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability. Every run offers new combinations, new builds, and new challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/0f4e1cd34b2c07fd5e97aa2456cf5da6.poster.avif?t=1773742740\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332060/extras/0f4e1cd34b2c07fd5e97aa2456cf5da6.webm?t=1773742740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/333206